---
title: "releaseVestedTokens (Shared across sale types)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_vesting: check position.vestingAddress != address(0)
    q_check_vesting --> q_revert_no_vesting: no vesting contract
    q_revert_no_vesting --> [*]: revert NoVestingContract
    q_check_vesting --> q_call_release: vesting contract exists
    q_call_release --> q_calc: LegionLinearVesting.release()
    q_calc --> q_check_amount: calculate releasable = vested - alreadyReleased
    q_check_amount --> q_transfer: releasable > 0
    q_check_amount --> q_revert_none: releasable == 0
    q_revert_none --> [*]: revert NothingToRelease
    q_transfer --> [*]: transfer(beneficiary, releasable), emit TokensReleased

    note right of q_calc
        INV-001: linear vesting over configured duration
        INV-002: releasable amount monotonically increases over time
        INV-003: total released never exceeds total vested allocation
    end note
